{title: Barlovento}
{artist: Aldemaro Romero}
{year: 1950}
{key: Dm}
{time: 6/8}

{define: Dm base-fret 1 frets 2 2 1 0}
{define: F+ base-fret 1 frets 2 1 1 0}
{define: F base-fret 1 frets 2 0 1 0}
{define: Asus4 base-fret 1 frets 2 2 0 0}
{define: A7 base-fret 1 frets 0 1 0 0}
{define: C base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 3}
{define: Gm base-fret 1 frets 0 2 3 1}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
La línea de la introducción también se puede tocar Dm↓ F+↓ F↓ F+↓ Dm↓ Asus4↓ Dm · · Dm↑

[Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]·  · · [Dm]↑
[Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]·  · · [Dm]↑
[Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]·  · · [Dm]↑
[Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  | [Dm]·  · · [Dm]↑

[A7]·  · · · · · | [Dm]·  · · · · ·
[A7]·  · · · · · | [Dm]·  · · · · ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
Barlo[Dm]vento, Barlo[Dm]vento, tierra ar[A7]diente y del tam[Dm]bor,
Barlo[Dm]vento, Barlo[Dm]vento, tierra ar[A7]diente y del tam[Dm]bor,

[C]Tierra de las fu[C]lías y negras [F]finas,
[Gm]Que llevan de [A7]fiesta [A7]su cintura [Dm]prieta
Y al [Gm]son de la cur[Dm]beta y el taki-[A7]taki de la [Dm]mina
Y al [Gm]son de la cur[Dm]beta y el taki-[A7]taki de la [Dm]mina
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 2}
Sa[Dm]↓broso que [Dm]↓mueve el [Dm]↓cuerpo
[Dm]↓la barloven[Dm]↓teña cuan[Dm]↓do ca[Dm]mina, [Dm]↑

Sa[Dm]↓broso que [Dm]↓suena el [Dm]↓taki-
[Dm]↓takitaki[Dm]↓taki so[Dm]↓bre la [Dm]mina [Dm]↑

Que [C]vengan los conuque[F]ros para el bai[C]le de San [F]Juan,
Que [C]vengan los conuque[F]ros para el bai[C]le de San [F]↓Juan,

Que la [Dm]↓mina es[Dm]↓tá tem[Dm]↓plada
pa'[Dm]↓ so[Dm]↓na' el ti[Dm]↓tiki-[Dm]taki [Dm]↑

Que la [Dm]↓mina es[Dm]↓tá tem[Dm]↓plada
pa'[Dm]↓ so[Dm]↓na' el ti[Dm]↓tiki
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[Dm]Taki-ti-taki [A7] Tiki-tiki [Dm]Taki-ti-taki [A7] Tiki-tiki
[Dm]Taki-ti-taki [A7] Tiki-tiki [Dm]Taki-ti-taki [A7] Tiki-tiki-[Dm]tá

Repetir desde el inicio y luego al Outro
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  [Gm]↓  [A7]↓
[Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  [Gm]↓  [A7]↓
[Dm]↓  [Dm]↓  [Gm]↓  [A7]↓
[Dm]↓
